      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In experiments on rats with different models of pathology it was demonstrated that a new non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drug pyrimidant exerts pronounced anti-inflammatory, analgesic and antipyretic effects. In some cases its activity exceeds that of indomethacin, brufen, butadione, mefenamic acid, sodium salicylate."},
